<head>
<title>Verschillende rollen</title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Een transdisciplinaire</span><span style="margin: 0px"> samenwerking vraagt om de invulling van bestaande en nieuwe rollen. Deze rollen kunnen tijdens het proces veranderen. Rollen waar je aan kunt denken zijn:</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><br></p><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;">Aanjager&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Coördinator&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Netwerker&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Kenniskoppelaar&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Facilitator van proces&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Expert&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Doener&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Verbinder&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-top: 0cm">
